flowchart TD
    A[Start Game] --> B[Load Level]
    B --> C[Create Player and Enemies]
    C --> D[Render Board and HUD]
    D --> E{Player Input?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Try Player Move]
    E -->|No| G[Tick Update]
    F --> H{Valid Move?}
    H -->|No| D
    H -->|Yes| I[Update Player Position]
    I --> J{Collect Item?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Increase Score and Remove Item]
    J -->|No| L[Continue]
    K --> L
    L --> M{All Items Collected?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Load Next Level or End Game]
    M -->|No| G
    G --> O[Move Enemies]
    O --> P{Collision?}
    P -->|Player Powered| Q[Reset Enemy and Award Points]
    P -->|Player Hit| R[Lose Life and Reset Positions]
    P -->|No| D
    Q --> D
    R --> S{Lives Remaining?}
    S -->|Yes| D
    S -->|No| T[Game Over]
